Package: kulan-settings
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Depends: kulan-base (= @VERSION@), kulan-update-center (= @VERSION@), python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.12), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5)
Recommends: gnome-control-center, kulan-desktop-settings (= @VERSION@)
Breaks: kulan-update-center (<< 2.2~)
Replaces: kulan-update-center (<< 2.2~)
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ Settings
 One place for @NAME@ options: appearance (light, dark or automatic, accent
 colour, wallpaper, window buttons), the dock, the top bar, animations and
 app folders, Night Light and text size, keyboard, login items, add-ons and
 About @NAME@.
 .
 Updates and recovery (formerly Update Center) is part of it: available
 updates, what's new, update history, automatic updates and restore points.
 Pages that belong to GNOME Settings (Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, sound, displays,
 users) are listed too and open there.
